          "content": "Use deep agents when you want maximum capability with minimal setup; choose LangChain agents when you need fine-grained control.\n\n    To compare both in this step, install the `deepagents` package:\n\n    <CodeGroup>\n      ```bash uv theme={\"theme\":{\"light\":\"catppuccin-latte\",\"dark\":\"catppuccin-mocha\"}}\n      uv add deepagents\n      ```\n\n      ```bash pip theme={\"theme\":{\"light\":\"catppuccin-latte\",\"dark\":\"catppuccin-mocha\"}}\n      pip install -U deepagents\n      ```\n    </CodeGroup>\n\n    <Warning>\n      Since the code invokes the model with the entire text from The Great Gatsby, it uses a large amount of tokens.\n\n      You can view example output in the next step.\n    </Warning>\n\n    Let's try both:\n\n    ```python wrap theme={\"theme\":{\"light\":\"catppuccin-latte\",\"dark\":\"catppuccin-mocha\"}}\n    from langchain.agents import create_agent\n    from deepagents import create_deep_agent",
